  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed single storey side extension, by way of its size, scale, design, appearance, excessive width and inappropriate setbacks, would be a visually obtrusive feature that would not be in proportion to the dynamics of the existing dwelling and would consequently be detrimental to the character of the local street scene, given the sites prominent corner location.  The development is therefore contrary with policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development) and H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations) of The London Borough of Hounslow UDP, Adopted December 2003; and is not compliant with the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines."
